 of my character.\nI like this art a lot! https://skeb.jp/@OOOriverOOO/works/1\nHere is the character:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MJpc1E0iOiC9-2I0D0q7-1PY3fXQWFEQ?usp=sharing\nPlease do not draw him with a scar on the eye. It is optional to draw the parasite/creature attached to him. You can include it if you want, but you do not have to.\nHe is a boy with a soft, more feminine apperance. He is skinny and short. He just wears oversized clothes. \nYou can draw him in any pose.\nThank you so much for considering my request! I love your art and it is amazing.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MJpc1E0iOiC9-2I0D0q7-1PY3fXQWFEQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@OOOriverOOO/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a29e8f15/uploads/origins/d0d6f292-9871-4806-95db-809a2d97e4bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32813131e2fe59128dbfa13fc5c8d97e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a29e8f15/uploads/origins/d0d6f292-9871-4806-95db-809a2d97e4bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32813131e2fe59128dbfa13fc5c8d97e, https://si.imgix.net/a29e8f15/uploads/origins/d0d6f292-9871-4806-95db-809a2d97e4bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbf1de5f73bdb2476194481cdb13029b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a29e8f15/uploads/origins/d0d6f292-9871-4806-95db-809a2d97e4bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a99768e567fbab36f6915bcfe51be3b4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！作品をありがとう！とても気に入っています。私のOCを描いていただいてもいいですか？自由に描いてください！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OyFeTxo7x9RDMkLry1BPTbWCW8B2R4b-", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@OOOriverOOO/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80be1a1d/uploads/origins/24db5e58-a648-4f4a-b15d-76e3d1789da3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38c80755f7dd415af